{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:725d92a1895b7b11","name":"Exiled","source":{"id":"source:reference-725d92a1895b7b11","title":"Exiled","revision":20637,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:13:50Z","sha256":"38709dd36c26110b27f5aa34728f1c83c6c10f6c2359787987b2284fbd7ea01d","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20637","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Exiled&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-725d92a1895b7b11","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You were exiled from your home planet and cannot return. This Background differs from the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disgraced"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disgraced","referenceId":"reference:5107649006e822db"}," Background in that the Event that led to your exile was not targeted at you individually. Perhaps a member of your family defied the regional governor and the entire clan was forced into space, or perhaps your homeworld was destroyed by an Imperial superweapon while you were offworld. The event set you adrift in the galaxy and left you disconnected from everything you once knew.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Relevant Skills:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gather Information"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gather_Information","referenceId":"reference:a719fb58321fb08c"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Galactic Lore)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Galactic_Lore)"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Survival"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Survival","referenceId":"reference:8302496de0ace160"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Enhancement:"]}," As a result of your journeys around the galaxy, you can plot a safe course for hyperspace travel in half the time it normally takes (you can plot a course in 30 seconds, or 5 rounds). Additionally, if you are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Galactic Lore)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Galactic_Lore)"},", you gain the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Focus (Knowledge (Galactic Lore))"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Focus_(Knowledge_(Galactic_Lore))"}," feat as a conditional bonus ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feat"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
